<div class="frameworks">
  {counters}
  <div class="card framework" style="--framework: {$colour}">
    <div class="framework-head"><strong>{$framework}</strong><span class="badge">{$kilobytes} kB</span></div>
    <div data-island="{$island}" data-props="{^props}"><div class="counter"><div class="counter-value">{$props.start}</div></div></div>
  </div>
  {/counters}
</div>
<p class="muted small">The weight is what the browser fetches for the island the first time - the component, its framework's adapter
   and every chunk they import, uncompressed. A second island of the same framework costs only its component.</p>
